---
import ServiceLayout from '../../layouts/ServiceLayout.astro';
import GoldenList from '../../components/GoldenList.astro';
import GlassCard from '../../components/GlassCard.astro';
---

<ServiceLayout
  title="Growth Department as a Service"
  subtitle="A Full-Stack Growth Team. Instantly Deployed. Mathematically Cheaper."
  metaDescription="Don't hire a CMO. Hire a system. Get a Strategist, Media Buyer, Developer, and Creative Director for less than the cost of one senior employee."
>

  <h2>The Hiring Nightmare</h2>
  <p>
    You are ready to scale. You need a team. You have two bad options:
  </p>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>The Agency Roulette:</strong> You hire a big agency. They pitch you the "A-Team" but assign you the "C-Team" (interns). Communication is slow. Results are vague.</li>
    <li><strong>The In-House Trap:</strong> You try to hire. You spend 3 months recruiting. You pay recruiters 20%. You pay a $150k salary + benefits. Then, 6 months later, you realize they are a "culture mismatch" or they quit.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>
    <strong>There is a third option.</strong>
  </p>

  <hr class="border-white/10 my-12" />

  <h2>The "Growth Pod" Model</h2>
  <p>
    We deploy a pre-built, combat-tested <strong>Growth Pod</strong> into your slack channel. These are not interns. These are senior operators who have spent millions in ad spend and built 8-figure funnels.
  </p>
  
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 my-12 not-prose">
    <div class="p-4 bg-[#111] border border-white/10 rounded-sm text-center">
      <div class="text-gold-500 font-bold mb-2">The Strategist</div>
      <div class="text-xs text-gray-400">Fractional CMO.<br/>Sets the vision.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="p-4 bg-[#111] border border-white/10 rounded-sm text-center">
      <div class="text-gold-500 font-bold mb-2">The Buyer</div>
      <div class="text-xs text-gray-400">Ad Specialist.<br/>Manages the money.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="p-4 bg-[#111] border border-white/10 rounded-sm text-center">
      <div class="text-gold-500 font-bold mb-2">The Builder</div>
      <div class="text-xs text-gray-400">Full Stack Dev.<br/>Codes the funnels.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="p-4 bg-[#111] border border-white/10 rounded-sm text-center">
      <div class="text-gold-500 font-bold mb-2">The Creative</div>
      <div class="text-xs text-gray-400">Video Editor.<br/>Makes the ads.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>The Economics: Why This Wins</h2>
  <p>
    Let's do the math.
  </p>
  <p>
    To hire this team in-house would cost you <strong>$450,000/year</strong> in payroll alone (CMO $150k + Dev $100k + Buyer $80k + Creative $70k + Taxes).
  </p>
  <p>
    Our Retainer is a fraction of that cost. And you can fire us anytime. We carry the risk, not you.
  </p>

  <h2>How We Work: Sprint Methodology</h2>
  <p>
    We do not operate on "vague monthly goals." We operate on <strong>Weekly Sprints</strong>.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Monday:</strong> Sprint Planning. We agree on the 3 core objectives for the week.</li>
    <li><strong>Wednesday:</strong> Mid-Week Optimization. We cut losers and scale winners.</li>
    <li><strong>Friday:</strong> EOD Report. Pure data. What did we spend? What did we make? What is the plan for next week?</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    You get a dedicated Slack channel. You get instant communication. We become part of your company DNA, but without the HR headaches.
  </p>

  <hr class="border-white/10 my-12" />

  <h2>Technical Specifications</h2>
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 not-prose">
    <GlassCard title="Full Tech Stack Access">
      <p class="text-sm mt-4 text-gray-400">
        We bring our own enterprise tools. You save $2,000/mo on software licenses (Ahrefs, VWO, ClickFunnels, Hyros) because we already paid for them.
      </p>
    </GlassCard>
    <GlassCard title="Asset Ownership">
      <p class="text-sm mt-4 text-gray-400">
        Everything we build belongs to you. If we ever part ways, you keep the funnels, the data, the ad accounts, and the creative assets. No hostage taking.
      </p>
    </GlassCard>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-16 p-8 border border-gold-500/30 bg-gold-900/5 rounded-lg text-center">
    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Deploy Your Team</h3>
    <p class="text-gray-300 mb-8">
      We have capacity for 1 new Growth Pod deployment this month.
    </p>
    <a href="/#audit" class="inline-block px-8 py-4 bg-gold-500 hover:bg-gold-400 text-black font-bold uppercase tracking-widest rounded-sm transition-colors">
      Apply For Deployment
    </a>
  </div>

</ServiceLayout>
